Package: vhsR
Title: Animated Terminal Demos for R via 'vhs'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("David", "Schoch", , "david.schoch@cynkra.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Wraps the 'vhs' command-line tool from Charm
    (<https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs>) so that animated GIF demos
    of R code can be produced from a single R expression.
